                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A really fun game when i first started playing it was kind of boring but when i kept playing the levels it was a lot of fun , The Cat Queen has been kidnapped by the Foxes and The Cat King sended 4 kitties on a mission to rescue her , also this is not a WASD type of game its a game where the kitties run automatically and u just click to jump but u have to time the jumps too , this is also a flash game and this is just a better version on steam ,  it doesnt require a lot of skill and its relaxing , the later levels do become harder but its possible , i also got this game for a really cheap steam key",
